      "default": null,
      "resolution": "single",
      "tenant": null,
      "note": "The personal agent's own browser (§6): load_join_form opens the browser-session endpoint and returns the one-time code from that page only; once the agent has authorized the code at {endpoint}/authorize, submit_join_form submits the form from the same browser, whose SameSite=Strict cookie ties the code to it. No proof: the access token never passes through the browser."
