      "tenant": "SessionJwtRequest.tenant_id",
      "note": "Signs the Session JWT of one request (§5.2) from a SessionJwtRequest: method, url, tenant_id, issuer, client_id, sid, sub, agent_id, access_token. DelegatedSessionSigner keeps one delegated P-256 key per (tenant_id, issuer, sub) in a DelegatedKeyCustody, never shared across User IDs, its delegation signed by the pap.signer key with purpose delegation, rotated before exp."
